      "structure_description": "The Er48 tube comprises two Er18 wheels sandwiching an Er12 ring. Chloride ions occupy the wheel cavities and a nitrate ion occupies the tube center; both template the structure through hydrogen bonding. Nicotinate ligands and bridging azide connect the Er48 units into a two-dimensional layer."
